# specrot's own repository: these files cite old RFCs on purpose (examples, evaluation data, the RFC graph)
* docs/*            # explorer data and its demo text
* scripts/*         # evaluation inputs, labels and results
* facts.json        # numbers about the graph
* README.md         # examples and results about obsolete RFCs
* skills/*          # agent instructions with examples
* specrot/*         # code comments and help text naming the RFCs it handles
* action.yml        # example citations
